  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Farmers Feed Fish Enterprise Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to assist FFACS in expanding its catfish operations by constructing a feed mill factory; ten additional fish ponds and five hatchery ponds and purchasing machinery in order to produce fish feed; a fish dryer; and a pick-up truck in order to establish a retail outlet and acquire a cold room.</narrative>
  </description>
